{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353390/extras/9cd4ade7624f6eaddb492b8beda708eb.avif?t=1759525460\" width=780 height=70 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353390/extras/5a7d37e5132d8b75613e03e1d12a139e.poster.avif?t=1759525460\" width=780 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353390/extras/5a7d37e5132d8b75613e03e1d12a139e.webm?t=1759525460\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353390/extras/5a7d37e5132d8b75613e03e1d12a139e.mp4?t=1759525460\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge a single starcraft into a fleet-leveling warship through the combination of salvaged weaponry and strategy-defining augmentations in this sci-fi survivors game! Weave through asteroid fields, aid galactic denizens, and use collected resources from each failed expedition to become permanently stronger! Your goal is survival; your legacy is inevitable.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intense Bullet-Heaven Combat</strong> - Obliterate endless swarms of alien and pirate combatants on your journey to challenge the enemy flagship! Evade devastating bombardments with unique movement abilities and return fire automatically or manually.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable Starcraft\u00a0</strong> - Master <strong>6\u00a0</strong>ships, each with distinct starting armaments and combat styles. Customize your ship's systems for a fine-tuned strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapon and Ship Augmentation</strong> - Forge endless builds  with <strong>6</strong> core weapons and over <strong>115</strong> augments to empower your arsenal!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Galactic</strong> - Navigate a galaxy that changes every expedition\u2014traverse sectors with treacherous, gameplay-altering conditions to complete missions that are no less dangerous.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative Encounters</strong> - Face dynamic encounters where your choices matter! Reap reward or catastrophic consequence for investigating deep-space anomalies, bribing enforcers, or rescuing stranded scientists!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meta Progression</strong> - Exchange salvaged resources for permanent enhancements, new starcraft, additional crew members, and more to aid you in future runs!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353390/extras/d5bdbb871bf84f329f571446ae26ffac.avif?t=1759525460\" width=780 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353390/extras/1fd7ccdfbe0e8c749230fa53743d982d.poster.avif?t=1759525460\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353390/extras/1fd7ccdfbe0e8c749230fa53743d982d.webm?t=1759525460\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353390/extras/1fd7ccdfbe0e8c749230fa53743d982d.mp4?t=1759525460\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master\u00a0unique starcraft across three classes: nimble frigates, versatile cruisers, and titanic battleships. All ships\u2014through their <i>special augments</i>, <i>weapons</i>, and <i>movement abilities</i>\u2014lend themselves to unique playstyles and combat specializations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353390/extras/e0d05ba52d382d996e6f51f88587099f.avif?t=1759525460\" width=780 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353390/extras/8c77191354f3b8d00f71e804863d3ae5.poster.avif?t=1759525460\" width=780 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353390/extras/8c77191354f3b8d00f71e804863d3ae5.webm?t=1759525460\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353390/extras/8c77191354f3b8d00f71e804863d3ae5.mp4?t=1759525460\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover over <strong>115 </strong>weapon and ship augments<strong> </strong>to create game-breaking synergies and redefine your strategy each expedition!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transform your hull with augments like <strong>Pulsing Plating</strong>, enabling your ship to release a forceful burst of energy when sustaining damage, or deploy <strong>Proximity Mines</strong> to eliminate pursuing fighters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance your combat prowess with <strong>Smart Rounds</strong>, ammunition that ricochets between targets, or <strong>Nuclear Warheads</strong>, radioactive payloads that leave a damaging, lingering cloud in their wake!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353390/extras/81c4541b4f6bd08ca3dbe368f1908ad8.avif?t=1759525460\" width=780 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353390/extras/bcd4d89ca717de4a4e7b0b893f128b56.poster.avif?t=1759525460\" width=780 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353390/extras/bcd4d89ca717de4a4e7b0b893f128b56.webm?t=1759525460\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353390/extras/bcd4d89ca717de4a4e7b0b893f128b56.mp4?t=1759525460\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your <strong>Starmap</strong> is a web of opportunity and peril. Choose your path through hazardous sectors and encounter space stations in need of reinforcements, inhabited planets under siege from The Observers, and derelict ships with priceless data in need of salvaging. Completing these missions, as well as random secondary objectives, will earn you rewards crucial to your survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353390/extras/7439ff72956b0fcbe5f186e675d8b968.avif?t=1759525460\" width=780 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353390/extras/b65db36ad790b585ea7a8ec509882ce8.poster.avif?t=1759525460\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353390/extras/b65db36ad790b585ea7a8ec509882ce8.webm?t=1759525460\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353390/extras/b65db36ad790b585ea7a8ec509882ce8.mp4?t=1759525460\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death is not the end. Battlefield wreckage, recovered data, and alien technologies salvaged from your failed expeditions can be exchanged for powerful, <strong>permanent upgrades</strong> to your arsenal!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Early Development Disclaimer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Starforged Legacy</i>\u00a0is currently in early development. The features we currently have and those planned for the future may change as we gather feedback from our community. You can expect to see these changes reflected here as they occur.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3353390?t=1759525460","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353390/72d00f226f8c0394d1a771d3bace4c3e41ba712d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759525460","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353390/b164a84008d4024a8e79f89db0ae2df5d8e56930/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759525460","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353390/b164a84008d4024a8e79f89db0ae2df5d8e56930/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759525460","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353390/extras/9cd4ade7624f6eaddb492b8beda708eb.avif?t=1759525460\" width=780 height=70 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353390/extras/5a7d37e5132d8b75613e03e1d12a139e.poster.avif?t=1759525460\" width=780 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353390/extras/5a7d37e5132d8b75613e03e1d12a139e.webm?t=1759525460\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353390/extras/5a7d37e5132d8b75613e03e1d12a139e.mp4?t=1759525460\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge a single starcraft into a fleet-leveling warship through the combination of salvaged weaponry and strategy-defining augmentations in this sci-fi survivors game! Weave through asteroid fields, aid galactic denizens, and use collected resources from each failed expedition to become permanently stronger! Your goal is survival; your legacy is inevitable.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intense Bullet-Heaven Combat</strong> - Obliterate endless swarms of alien and pirate combatants on your journey to challenge the enemy flagship! Evade devastating bombardments with unique movement abilities and return fire automatically or manually.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable Starcraft\u00a0</strong> - Master <strong>6\u00a0</strong>ships, each with distinct starting armaments and combat styles. Customize your ship's systems for a fine-tuned strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapon and Ship Augmentation</strong> - Forge endless builds  with <strong>6</strong> core weapons and over <strong>115</strong> augments to empower your arsenal!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Galactic</strong> - Navigate a galaxy that changes every expedition\u2014traverse sectors with treacherous, gameplay-altering conditions to complete missions that are no less dangerous.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative Encounters</strong> - Face dynamic encounters where your choices matter! Reap reward or catastrophic consequence for investigating deep-space anomalies, bribing enforcers, or rescuing stranded scientists!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meta Progression</strong> - Exchange salvaged resources for permanent enhancements, new starcraft, additional crew members, and more to aid you in future runs!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353390/extras/d5bdbb871bf84f329f571446ae26ffac.avif?t=1759525460\" width=780 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353390/extras/1fd7ccdfbe0e8c749230fa53743d982d.poster.avif?t=1759525460\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353390/extras/1fd7ccdfbe0e8c749230fa53743d982d.webm?t=1759525460\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353390/extras/1fd7ccdfbe0e8c749230fa53743d982d.mp4?t=1759525460\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master\u00a0unique starcraft across three classes: nimble frigates, versatile cruisers, and titanic battleships. All ships\u2014through their <i>special augments</i>, <i>weapons</i>, and <i>movement abilities</i>\u2014lend themselves to unique playstyles and combat specializations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353390/extras/e0d05ba52d382d996e6f51f88587099f.avif?t=1759525460\" width=780 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353390/extras/8c77191354f3b8d00f71e804863d3ae5.poster.avif?t=1759525460\" width=780 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353390/extras/8c77191354f3b8d00f71e804863d3ae5.webm?t=1759525460\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353390/extras/8c77191354f3b8d00f71e804863d3ae5.mp4?t=1759525460\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover over <strong>115 </strong>weapon and ship augments<strong> </strong>to create game-breaking synergies and redefine your strategy each expedition!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transform your hull with augments like <strong>Pulsing Plating</strong>, enabling your ship to release a forceful burst of energy when sustaining damage, or deploy <strong>Proximity Mines</strong> to eliminate pursuing fighters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance your combat prowess with <strong>Smart Rounds</strong>, ammunition that ricochets between targets, or <strong>Nuclear Warheads</strong>, radioactive payloads that leave a damaging, lingering cloud in their wake!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353390/extras/81c4541b4f6bd08ca3dbe368f1908ad8.avif?t=